; A wrecked hauler: longer and boxier than the player's arrowhead, with its spine broken
; open amidships. DerelictShip copies these polygons for its visual and takes the one
; named "Polygon2D" for its collision outline, so that name matters. Colours are
; Colors.gd values (CREAM, HULL_MID, HULL_DARK, HULL_LIGHT); DerelictShip tints the lot
; down to a powered-off hull.

